  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.11: \n - Added support for Nerdbank.GitVersioning\n - thanks Reza Niroomand (Microsoft MVP, @rezanid) for issuing a PR with the new feature. \n\nv1.0.10: \n - Solution Version is shown when packing solution.\n - Avoids appending Publisher Prefix to already prefixed Plugin Package \n - thanks Reza Niroomand (Microsoft MVP, @rezanid) for finding these issues and issuing a PR with the fixes. \n\nv1.0.9: \n - Fixed bug with plugin package not getting the right version sometimes (ex. 1.0.1.0 would throw).\n - AppendTargetFrameworkToOutputPath set to false by default to preserve paths same as MS Package.\n \nv1.0.8: \n - Fixed bug incorrectly generating pluginpackage.xml file when no plugin packages are referenced.\n\nv1.0.7:\n - Improved support for ManagedIdentities in Plugins\n\nv1.0.6:\n - Added support for ManagedIdentity in plugins\n\nv1.0.5:\n -  Regenerate pluginpackage.xml when packing plugin packages.\n\nThis might get deleted by doing pac solution sync\n\nv1.0.4:\n - correctly excluding _SetFileVersionOnSolution to prevent unintentional file update\n\nv1.0.3:\n - Updates solution version when FileVersion property is specified on build\n\nv1.0.2:\n - Fixed bug with cds projects that don't reference a plugin package project\n\nv1.0.1:\n - Improved packages documentation and icon\n\nv1.0.0:\n - First release of AlbanianXrm.CDSProj.SDK",
